<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n> 출처: [A][B][C], Evans 파란책, Millett\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 10 ;
    djr:text "| 구분 | 문제 공간 (Problem Space) | 솔루션 공간 (Solution Space) |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:text "|------|-------------------------|---------------------------|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:text "| 질문 | \"비즈니스가 해결해야 할 문제는 무엇인가?\" | \"문제를 어떻게 소프트웨어로 해결할 것인가?\" |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:text "| 도구 | 도메인, 하위 도메인 | 바운디드 컨텍스트, 컨텍스트 맵 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b14> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 14 ;
    djr:text "| 활동 | 도메인 발견, 지식 탐구 | 모델링, 설계, 구현 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b15> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 15 ;
    djr:text "| 산출물 | 도메인 비전 선언문, 하위 도메인 맵 | 유비쿼터스 언어, 도메인 모델, 코드 |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b16> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 16 ;
    djr:text "```python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom enum import Enum\n\n\nclass SubdomainType(Enum):\n    CORE = \"core\"           # 핵심: 경쟁 우위의 원천\n    GENERIC = \"generic\"     # 일반: 모든 회사가 동일하게 수행\n    SUPPORTING = \"supporting\"  # 지원: 비즈니스 활동 보조\n\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\nclass Subdomain:\n    name: str\n    type: SubdomainType\n    description: str\n\n    @property\n    def should_build_in_house(self) -> bool:\n        return self.type == SubdomainType.CORE\n\n\n# 예시: 온라인 쇼핑몰 도메인 분석\nrecommendation_engine = Subdomain(\n    name=\"추천 엔진\",\n    type=SubdomainType.CORE,\n    description=\"사용자 행동 기반 개인화 추천 알고리즘\",\n)\n\nauthentication = Subdomain(\n    name=\"인증/권한\",\n    type=SubdomainType.GENERIC,\n    description=\"사용자 로그인 및 권한 관리\",\n)\n\nadmin_panel = Subdomain(\n    name=\"관리자 페이지\",\n    type=SubdomainType.SUPPORTING,\n    description=\"상품/주문 CRUD 인터페이스\",\n)\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "도메인은 소프트웨어가 해결하려는 비즈니스 영역이며, 여러 하위 도메인으로 구성된다. [C]에서는 하위 도메인을 \"문제점 공간(problem space)\"의 일부로 정의하고, 바운디드 컨텍스트를 \"해결책 공간(solution space)\"으로 분리하여 설명한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "**하위 도메인 유형** [B]:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s008-2.2> ;
