<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b11> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 11 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0642 ;
    djr:text "| 테스트 후보 입장 결정 | `discipline-tdd` |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 12 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0643 ;
    djr:text "| `add`된 통합/동시성/멱등성 테스트 mechanics | `implementation-test` |\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b13> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 13 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0632, djr:R-0633, djr:R-0634, djr:R-0635 ;
    djr:text "1. 바운디드 컨텍스트, 애그리거트, 불변식, 유스케이스, 외부 통합 경계를 확인한다.\n2. 실제 압력을 분류한다: 프레임워크 누수, 영속성 매핑, 트랜잭션 경계, 읽기/쓰기 모델 분기, 외부 부수효과 신뢰성, 레거시/업스트림 언어 충돌, 테스트 seam, 교체 필요.\n3. 현재 압력을 해결하는 가장 가벼운 패턴을 선택한다.\n4. 선택하지 않은 무거운 패턴과 그 이유를 함께 기록한다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0636 ;
    djr:text "단순 CRUD, 작은 필드 변경, 지원 하위 도메인의 직선적 흐름에는 리포지토리, 커스텀 Unit of Work, CQRS, 이벤트 소싱, saga, outbox, ACL을 기본으로 도입하지 않는다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0637 ;
    djr:text "**Risky Write(결제, 재고, 예약, 환불, 권한, ledger 등) 라우팅:** 패턴 선택은 여기서 정하고, 세부 구현/검증은 소유 영역으로 넘긴다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "| 항목 | 소유 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:text "|---|---|\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0638 ;
    djr:text "| 패턴 결정 (Django-native 트랜잭션 / 서비스 레이어 / 포트·어댑터 / outbox / saga / ACL / 추가 패턴 없음) | 이 문서(§5~§6) |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 8 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0639 ;
    djr:text "| 트랜잭션 owner, 부수효과 타이밍 | `implementation-django`(§16) |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8/b9> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s049-6.8> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 9 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0640 ;
    djr:text "| 락, 격리 수준, 인덱스, rollout | `architecture-db` |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 7. 복잡성 관리 원칙"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md> ;
    djr:sectionNumber "7" ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "\n> 출처: [B]\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:text "DDD의 전술 패턴은 궁극적으로 **시스템의 자유도를 줄여 복잡성을 낮추는 수단**이다.\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-0644, djr:R-0645, djr:R-0646 ;
    djr:text "핵심 통찰:\n- 복잡한 것을 불변성으로 감싸서 복잡성을 낮춘다 -- 이것이 애그리거트와 값 객체 패턴이 하는 것이다\n- 값 객체의 상태 관련 모든 비즈니스 로직은 자신의 경계 안에 있다\n- 비즈니스 로직은 비즈니스 불변성을 감싸고 보호하여 자유도를 줄인다\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-code ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "```python\n# 자유도 3: 세 값을 독립적으로 변경 가능 -> 예측 어려움\nclass ClassA:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self.a = 0  # 자유\n        self.b = 0  # 자유\n        self.c = 0  # 자유\n\n\n# 자유도 1: a만 알면 b, c가 결정됨 -> 예측 쉬움\nclass ClassB:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._a = 0\n\n    @property\n    def a(self) -> int:\n        return self._a\n\n    @a.setter\n    def a(self, value: int):\n        self._a = value\n        self._b = value // 2  # 불변성: a에 의해 결정\n        self._c = value // 3  # 불변성: a에 의해 결정\n```\n\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s050-7> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

