<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9/b10> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9> ;
