    djr:text "| 전술 | 도메인 서비스 | 여러 애그리거트에 걸친 무상태 도메인 로직. 애그리거트는 서비스를 모른다 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9/b12> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9> ;
