    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s010-2.4/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s010-2.4/b3> ;
    djr:text "| 전략 | 바운디드 컨텍스트 | 유비쿼터스 언어가 적용되는 명시적 경계. 하위 도메인은 발견, 바운디드 컨텍스트는 설계한다 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-table-row ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s009-2.3/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s009-2.3/b3> ;
    djr:text "| 전략 | 유비쿼터스 언어 | 모든 이해관계자가 동일한 비즈니스 용어 사용. 바운디드 컨텍스트 내에서만 유효 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9> ;
