    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s011-2.5/b2> ;
    djr:text "| 전략 | 컨텍스트 맵 | 바운디드 컨텍스트 간의 관계(파트너십, ACL, OHS 등)를 시각화 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9> ;
