    djr:text "| 전략 | 증류 | 핵심 도메인을 식별하고 일반/지원 하위 도메인으로부터 분리 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9> ;
