    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s016-3.1/b3> ;
    djr:text "| 전술 | 값 객체 | 불변, 식별자 없음, 속성 조합으로 동등성 판단 |\n" .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9/b8> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s052-9> ;
